This directory is the upstream source for the PatchModule reusable module.

When syncing to a project, use:

    rsync -av --delete /home/gabor/development/Reusables/PatchModule/ lib/PatchModule/

Run a diff before every sync to detect unexpected local drift in the project copy:

    diff -r /home/gabor/development/Reusables/PatchModule/ lib/PatchModule/

DO NOT edit files in the project's lib/PatchModule/ directory directly.
All changes must be made here (upstream) first, then synced.
